[6.520328, "o", "\r\nDesign: 8 shards, 64 small size classes, reusable private anonymous mappings.\r\nLarge reuse: >64 KiB through 1 MiB; all empty caches share a 2 MiB cap.\r\nCross-thread frees use immutable region ownership; trim touches no live object.\r\n"]
[9.5278, "o", "\r\nRecorded five-process comparison (shared laptop; not official scores):\r\n"]
[9.568523, "o", "Large throughput, 8 threads (calls/s): 43663.450 -> 74036.324\r\n"]
[9.56865, "o", "Large malloc p99, 8 threads (us): 1784.819 -> 1105.217\r\nMixed throughput, 8 threads (M calls/s): 57.639 -> 51.240\r\n"]
[9.578993, "o", "Cost: large burst VM rose 34.7%; mixed throughput median fell 11.1%.\r\nLimits: sparse survivors still pin regions; cache misses still have long tails.\r\n"]
[13.584335, "o", "\r\nReview: ARCHITECTURE.md, CHECKPOINT5.md, CHECKPOINT6.md and raw results.\r\nAI assistance disclosed in AUTHOR.md; permission is user-reported SPOC approval.\r\nThis review candidate has not been officially submitted.\r\n"]
